WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.126 --> 00:00:15.327
Roxy leaned toward Terrell.

2
00:00:15.347 --> 00:00:17.728
"I'll be right back," she said.

3
00:00:18.589 --> 00:00:19.890
Terrell's eyes went wide.

4
00:00:19.910 --> 00:00:22.751
"You can't get up while the Miners are pitching, Roxy!

5
00:00:23.191 --> 00:00:24.092
It's bad luck."

6
00:00:25.313 --> 00:00:26.353
Roxy rolled her eyes.

7
00:00:26.373 --> 00:00:29.615
"It's about Dale Rivers and Manny Gomez.

8
00:00:30.235 --> 00:00:31.316
They've disappeared.

9
00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:33.641
That's why they're not here today.

10
00:00:34.401 --> 00:00:35.501
I need to find them."

11
00:00:35.521 --> 00:00:37.142
"Oh no!"

12
00:00:37.542 --> 00:00:38.223
Terrell said.

13
00:00:38.243 --> 00:00:39.463
"Good luck."

14
00:00:41.884 --> 00:00:44.705
After Roxy left, a dark shadow covered the stadium.

15
00:00:46.046 --> 00:00:47.667
The crowd looked up and cheered.

16
00:00:54.229 --> 00:00:54.790
Jack said.

17
00:00:54.810 --> 00:00:56.430
"That's cool!"

18
00:00:58.351 --> 00:01:00.012
Roxy arrived at Police Headquarters.

19
00:01:01.056 --> 00:01:03.017
Detective Smith was watching a small monitor.

20
00:01:04.257 --> 00:01:05.978
"You have work to do, Detective."

21
00:01:06.979 --> 00:01:07.879
Roxy shook her head.

22
00:01:07.899 --> 00:01:11.300
"I can't believe you're watching Cooltube videos!"

23
00:01:12.381 --> 00:01:13.881
Detective Smith rolled his eyes.

24
00:01:13.901 --> 00:01:18.243
"I'm not watching Cooltube videos, Rocket Girl.

25
00:01:18.884 --> 00:01:22.465
I'm watching a security video from Metro City Stadium's parking lot.

26
00:01:22.725 --> 00:01:23.245
Take a look."

27
00:01:24.146 --> 00:01:25.726
Roxy leaned in to watch the video.

28
00:01:27.007 --> 00:01:29.148
She saw Dale Rivers and Manny Gomez talking.

29
00:01:30.172 --> 00:01:32.333
A dark shadow spread across the parking lot.

30
00:01:34.675 --> 00:01:36.196
The two baseball players looked up.

31
00:01:37.336 --> 00:01:38.277
They seemed scared.

32
00:01:39.537 --> 00:01:41.739
Then they quickly floated up and off the screen.

33
00:01:41.759 --> 00:01:45.100
"Where did they go?"

34
00:01:45.601 --> 00:01:46.261
Roxy asked.

35
00:01:46.281 --> 00:01:50.123
"Did someone—or something—take them?"

36
00:01:51.424 --> 00:01:52.785
Detective Smith shook his head.

37
00:01:52.805 --> 00:01:54.426
"I don't know."

38
00:01:55.166 --> 00:01:56.367
The detective's phone beeped.

39
00:01:57.848 --> 00:02:00.485
"Hello?" His face grew pale.

40
00:02:00.505 --> 00:02:04.369
"What? Oh no, that's terrible!"

41
00:02:04.389 --> 00:02:06.731
"Uh-oh," Roxy thought.

42
00:02:07.531 --> 00:02:08.252
Her watch beeped.

43
00:02:12.135 --> 00:02:13.596
She opened it and saw Terrell.

44
00:02:13.616 --> 00:02:16.359
"What's going on?"

45
00:02:16.699 --> 00:02:17.380
Roxy asked.

46
00:02:18.561 --> 00:02:21.903
"Roxy—I mean Rocket Girl," Terrell said.

47
00:02:21.924 --> 00:02:24.145
"You need to come back to the stadium!

48
00:02:24.966 --> 00:02:26.868
There's a giant baseball floating over it.

49
00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:29.301
At first I thought it was just a balloon.

50
00:02:30.082 --> 00:02:31.943
But now it's sucking up all the Miners!"

51
00:02:31.963 --> 00:02:34.605
"I'll be right there!"

52
00:02:35.245 --> 00:02:36.846
Roxy closed her watch and flew off.

53
00:02:38.808 --> 00:02:40.209
Detective Smith put down his phone.

54
00:02:40.229 --> 00:02:42.850
"There's a problem at the stadium, Rocket Girl.

55
00:02:42.890 --> 00:02:45.872
We have to Rocket Girl?"

56
00:02:50.696 --> 00:02:51.436
Roxy gulped.

57
00:02:52.257 --> 00:02:54.578
An enormous baseball was floating over the stadium.

58
00:02:55.539 --> 00:02:57.180
On the field below, she saw a man.

59
00:02:58.144 --> 00:03:00.965
He wore a Miners uniform and held a megaphone in one hand.

60
00:03:01.846 --> 00:03:03.706
In the other hand, he held a large bat.

61
00:03:04.247 --> 00:03:05.667
It was silver and shiny.

62
00:03:06.107 --> 00:03:06.988
Sparks shot from it.

63
00:03:07.008 --> 00:03:10.589
"That's Fitz Hitz," Roxy said.

64
00:03:10.609 --> 00:03:12.790
"Why is he on the field?

65
00:03:13.130 --> 00:03:14.731
He was kicked off the Miners."

66
00:03:14.751 --> 00:03:18.152
"Hello to all my fans!"

67
00:03:18.653 --> 00:03:19.333
Fitz grinned.

68
00:03:19.353 --> 00:03:23.675
"The rest of the team is, uh, tied up right now.

69
00:03:24.895 --> 00:03:26.476
But luckily you have me.

70
00:03:27.676 --> 00:03:31.762
And I have my new invention: the Blast Bat.

71
00:03:32.923 --> 00:03:36.348
I will happily play the Lumbertown Loggers—all by myself!"
